WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Welcome to Sherwood Forest, where a token can become more than a ticker.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Find a community. Follow the story. Make your move.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.360
Every trade helps the market grow. A share of the fees can build a reward basket chosen when the token is created.

00:15.360 --> 00:22.000
Holders can claim what they earn. Creators can build a following and share in the success they help create.

00:22.000 --> 00:31.840
Launching is simple. Pick a name. Add your look. Choose up to three reward assets. Then let the market decide how far your idea can run.

00:31.840 --> 00:40.000
As momentum builds, the token moves from its bonding curve into open trading, with liquidity locked for the long haul.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.720
And the whole forest has a heartbeat. Stake RDAO to share in platform rewards and take part in the decisions that shape what comes next.

00:48.720 --> 00:58.500
No empty hype. No mystery box. Just visible markets, clear rules, real communities, and rewards designed to move with them.

00:58.500 --> 01:06.454
Find the next breakout. Launch the story everyone wants to join. Trade communities. Harvest what they grow. Enter Sherwood Forest.
